    "preamble": "Sanjay Shadija vs State Of Chhattisgarh on 21 August, 2024",
    "facts": "As such also the appeal is not maintainable. This Court has directed the Registry of this Court to place on record whether any notification has been issued in pursuance of notification dated 09.10.2017 issued by the Government of Chhattisgarh, Department of Food and Civil Supplies. It has been brought to the notice of this Court that a memorandum has been issued by Registrar General of this Court on 17.11.2017 appointing all the District and Sessions Judge of every Civil District Court as Presiding Officer of the Food Safety Appellate Tribunal.",
